:: StoryTitle
City


:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "0AA6684C-4167-4E72-9A54-CITY-HOME-LINK",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "City Center",
  "zoom": 0.6
}


:: StoryInit
<<set setup.sharedVariables = ["visitedPark", "visitedObservatory", "visitedMuseum", "visitedBobaShop", "bookRead", "lastLocation"]>>
<<set setup.harvestUrlState = function () {
	var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
	State.variables.visitedPark = params.get("visitedPark") === "1";
	State.variables.visitedObservatory = params.get("visitedObservatory") === "1";
	State.variables.visitedMuseum = params.get("visitedMuseum") === "1";
	State.variables.visitedBobaShop = params.get("visitedBobaShop") === "1";
	State.variables.bookRead = params.get("bookRead") === "1";
	State.variables.lastLocation = params.get("lastLocation") || "city";
}>>
<<set setup.storyUrl = function (target) {
	var params = new URLSearchParams();
	params.set("visitedPark", State.variables.visitedPark ? "1" : "0");
	params.set("visitedObservatory", State.variables.visitedObservatory ? "1" : "0");
	params.set("visitedMuseum", State.variables.visitedMuseum ? "1" : "0");
	params.set("visitedBobaShop", State.variables.visitedBobaShop ? "1" : "0");
	params.set("bookRead", State.variables.bookRead ? "1" : "0");
	params.set("lastLocation", State.variables.lastLocation || "city");
	return target + "?" + params.toString();
}>>
<<set setup.syncUrl = function () {
	window.history.replaceState(null, "", setup.storyUrl("city.html"));
}>>
<<run setup.harvestUrlState()>>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>


:: City Center {"position":"300,300","size":"100,100"}
The city center gathers the streets into a bright uneasy knot. From here, every destination seems to know your name.

<<if $bookRead>>
The book from home has made the city more legible, though not kinder.
<</if>>

* [[Walk to the park|Park]]
* [[Climb to the observatory|Observatory]]
* [[Enter the museum|Museum]]
* [[Visit the boba shop|Boba Shop]]
* [[Return home|Return Home]]


:: Park {"position":"150,300","size":"100,100"}
<<set $visitedPark = true>>
<<set $lastLocation = "park">>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>
The park is green in a way that feels theatrical. Paths curve around a dry fountain, and the trees whisper like pages being turned.

[[Back to the city center|City Center]]


:: Observatory {"position":"300,150","size":"100,100"}
<<set $visitedObservatory = true>>
<<set $lastLocation = "observatory">>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>
At the observatory, a brass telescope points at a gap between stars. You look through it and see a window lit inside your own house.

[[Back to the city center|City Center]]


:: Museum {"position":"450,300","size":"100,100"}
<<set $visitedMuseum = true>>
<<set $lastLocation = "museum">>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>
The museum is full of portraits, stage props, and yellowed playbills. One placard is blank except for your reflection.

[[Back to the city center|City Center]]


:: Boba Shop {"position":"300,450","size":"100,100"}
<<set $visitedBobaShop = true>>
<<set $lastLocation = "bobaShop">>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>
The boba shop glows with clean tile, soft music, and sealed cups. For a few minutes, the city seems almost ordinary.

[[Back to the city center|City Center]]


:: Return Home {"position":"450,150","size":"100,100"}
<<set $lastLocation = "cityCenter">>
<<run setup.syncUrl()>>
The route home folds through side streets and under yellow signs.

<<link "Open the front door">><<run window.location.href = setup.storyUrl("home.html")>><</link>>
